venv/
uv.lock

# Node
# Both forms on purpose: a trailing slash matches DIRECTORIES ONLY, so a stray
# `node_modules` SYMLINK slips past it and `git add -A` commits it. That
# happened (removed in f1132ad); on checkout it leaves a broken self-
# referential link where the install belongs, and pnpm/tsc/vitest all fail
# there — tsc exits 216 with no output, which is an unhelpful way to find out.
node_modules
node_modules/
dist/
*.tgz
node/package/
node/package */

# Test output
**/test_output.json

# General
.env
.DS_Store

